      "body": "Closes #5989.\n\nResearch deliverable for #5989 (worlds design program #5955, statements S77/S110): a prior-art survey of capability systems and shared-world prior art, mapped against our model.\n\nContents — per-system entries, each closing with an explicit adopt / adapt / reject line:\n- Object-capability theory: E, Joule, Cap'n Proto/CapTP, seL4/CHERI capability work\n- Spritely Goblins and OCapN (incl. sturdy references), petnames\n- CRDTs — with the CRDT-shaped vs authority-shaped line for world state drawn explicitly — plus Habitat/Second Life \"real estate\" and Croquet\n- WASI / WebAssembly component model as the industrial form of our compile-time platform ceilings\n\nSynthesis maps each finding to the #5955 children it feeds: programming-model child, capability-model child, identity/invites (#5751), writer-set authority (#5545), self-hosting child. The survey flags one open gap for the capability-model child: our revocation story for passed-in capabilities is not yet written.\n\nDocs-only; no implementation. Produced by queue task 14317 (lane code-x).\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796796896&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=7986&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F7986&signature=807cd87c7ced85a175ef3d9a02f6bbf51ba3f15dcb1cc7bb3d81cb6f8cbb6149\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup><a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/