      "body": "Fixes #4094\n\n`loadConfig` (bin/proxy-supervise.mjs) validated ports only per proxy — canonical range, `canonicalPort + altPortOffset <= 65535` — and deduplicated proxy *names*, but never compared the port sets of different proxies. Each proxy claims two ports at runtime (canonical + alternate) on its host, and reconcile health-checks/spawns on exactly those two, keying health on the port alone, so a same-host collision could be recorded as a healthy instance of the wrong proxy.\n\nChange: during the existing validation loop, each proxy now registers both of its port claims (`host:port`, host defaulting to `127.0.0.1` as in the runtime defaults) and `loadConfig` fails fast — naming the config file, both proxies, the field, and the port — when a claim is already taken. Same port on a different host stays valid.\n\nVerification (laptop, node v24.21.0):\n- `node --test bin/proxy-supervise.test.mjs`: 17/17 pass, including the new test covering canonical/canonical, canonical/alternate, alternate/alternate collisions plus different-host and distinct-port controls.\n- Independent probe of the patched `loadConfig`: distinct ports ACCEPTED, different-host same port ACCEPTED, all three collision shapes REJECTED with the naming error.\n\n🤖 Agent: new-issue-creator-code-b (guarded self-solve, lifecycle protocol §4; queue task 5989 cancelled as self-assigned)\n\n<!-- codesmith:footer -->\n---\n<a href=\"https://app.blacksmith.sh/developing-today/codesmith/code/pr/4095?autoLogin=true&ref=codesmith_pr_footer\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-light-v3.svg\"><img alt=\"View with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/view-with-codesmith-dark-v3-3x.png\" width=\"162\" height=\"28\"></picture></a> <a href=\"https://backend.blacksmith.sh/track/enable-autofix?expires=1796172356&installation_model_id=443529&pr_number=4095&ref=codesmith_pr_footer&repository=developing-today%2Fcode&return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2Fdeveloping-today%2Fcode%2Fpull%2F4095&signature=875d190f4722e0e81b44a7f9c2fb47c6dd3397aaad4a01faf114bfd1d7c3f892\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark.svg\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-light.svg\"><img alt=\"Autofix with [code]smith\" src=\"https://pr-comments-assets.blacksmith.sh/codesmith/autofix-with-codesmith-dark-3x.png\" width=\"190\" height=\"28\"></picture></a>\n<sup>Need help on this PR? Tag <code>@codesmith-bot</code> with what you need.</sup>\n\n<!-- codesmith:autofix:disabled -->\n<!-- /codesmith:footer -->",
